1 to 2025, and July to August came in under 90% of normal in 34 of those 75 years, the same count as January to February. In 2025, Jul-Aug came in at 53% of normal and Aug-Sep at 58% on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, Mar-Apr came in at 159% and Apr-May at 144% there. Grid 25397 had its driest year in 1963 at 64% of normal.</p>"}
